      "Mistake 4: Booking FTL for partial loads. If cargo is under 6 tonnes, PTL saves 25–35%. The shared truck model is India's fastest-growing freight segment at 9.7% CAGR (MarkWide Research, 2026).",
      "Mistake 5: Booking too late. Last-minute bookings cost 15–20% more due to limited availability. Post shipments 24–48 hours in advance for best rates and trucker options.",
      "Mistake 6: Skipping insurance. Cargo insurance costs 0.3–0.5% of declared value but protects against loss, damage, and theft. Always declare accurate cargo value.",
