      "How LoadSaathi Helps Jharkhand Truckers. LoadSaathi AI matching connects Jharkhand truckers with return loads across all major corridors. The platform real-time notifications push return-load offers as truckers approach their destination. For Kolkata-specific return-load strategies, see our [finding return loads from Kolkata guide](/blog/return-loads-kolkata). Truckers using LoadSaathi report 40-60% reduction in empty kilometres. The credit score system helps new owners build trust with shippers over time.",
